   508	- All output (reports, fingerprints, graphs) goes to stdout.
   509	- All error messages go to stderr.
   510	- The tool must be deterministic: given the same manifest and inputs, it must always produce the same report (except for the `timestamp` field and `timing_ms` values).
   511	- When comparing paths, always use forward slashes (`/`), even on Windows.
