[?2004hroot@n30009:/app# nl -ba docs/spec_v1.md | sed -n '75,119p'
[?2004l    75	1. Start with the current OS environment.
    76	2. Set `LC_ALL` to the manifest's `locale`.
    77	3. Set `TZ` to the manifest's `timezone`.
    78	4. If `seed` is set, set `REPRO_SEED` to its string representation.
    79	5. If `normalize_timestamps` is true, set `SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH` to `"0"`.
    80	6. Apply all `env_vars` from the manifest (overwriting any existing values).
    81	7. Apply all `env_overrides` from the step (overwriting any existing values).
    82	8. Remove all variables listed in `blocked_env_vars`.
    83	
    84	### 2.4 Step Schema
    85	
    86	```json
    87	{
    88	  "id": "<string>",
    89	  "command": "<string>",
    90	  "working_dir": "<string>",
    91	  "inputs": ["<path>", ...],
    92	  "outputs": ["<path>", ...],
    93	  "depends_on": ["<step_id>", ...],
    94	  "timeout_seconds": <integer>,
    95	  "env_overrides": { "<key>": "<value>", ... }
    96	}
    97	```
    98	
    99	| Field | Type | Required | Default | Description |
   100	|-------|------|----------|---------|-------------|
   101	| `id` | string | yes | — | Unique step identifier. Must match `^[a-z][a-z0-9_-]{0,63}$`. |
   102	| `command` | string | yes | — | Shell command executed via `sh -c "<command>"`. |
   103	| `working_dir` | string | no | `"."` | Working directory relative to the pipeline root. |
   104	| `inputs` | array | no | `[]` | Input file paths relative to the pipeline root. |
   105	| `outputs` | array | no | `[]` | Output file paths relative to the pipeline root. |
   106	| `depends_on` | array | no | `[]` | IDs of steps that must complete before this step. |
   107	| `timeout_seconds` | integer | no | `300` | Max execution time in seconds. Step is killed and marked `TIMEOUT` if exceeded. |
   108	| `env_overrides` | object | no | `{}` | Per-step environment variable overrides, applied after manifest-level environment. |
   109	
   110	**Validation rules:**
   111	- All step IDs must be unique.
   112	- All `depends_on` references must resolve to existing step IDs.
   113	- The dependency graph must be a DAG (no cycles).
   114	- Input paths must exist at the time of step execution (after all dependency steps have completed).
   115	- Output paths need not exist before execution; the step is expected to create them.
   116	
   117	---
   118	
   119	## 3. CLI Interface
