    75	#### `min_consistency_rate`
    76	
[?2004hroot@n30009:/app# nl -ba /app/docs/spec_v2.md | sed -n '77,110p'
[?2004l    77	Requires that at least a specified fraction of passes produce identical output, but does not require 100% consistency.
    78	
